              %a{:href => "https://www.isical.ac.in/~rcbose/internship/lectures2016/rt08deutschjozsa.pdf"}> pdf
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1098/rspa.1992.0167"} doi:10.1098/rspa.1992.0167
          %p
            and became widely appreciated in 1996/1997 with the discovery of several practically interesting
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algorithms"} algorithms
            exhibiting “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+supremacy"}> quantum supremacy
            ”, such as:
          %p
