                %strong 464
                (2010) 45–53 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1038/nature08812"}> doi:10.1038/nature08812
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Monograph on experimental realizations of
            = succeed "/" do
